{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Use this when a seller wants supplier pricing for a specific print-on-demand product size or color, such as an adult M black T-shirt or an 11 oz mug. Lists the product's fields and supported configurations for the destination and currency; narrow with words or choices. Pass a returned key as optionKey, or its choices, to compare_product. Search products first to obtain canonicalProductId. Supported destinations: US, GB, DE, AU, CA.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"canonicalProductId":{"pattern":"^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]*$","type":"string"},"choices":{"additionalProperties":{"maxLength":120,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"description":"Choices by field, such as { \"size\": \"m\", \"color\": \"black\" }. Values match a value key, its last part or its label, case-insensitively; get_product_options lists them.","propertyNames":{"maxLength":60,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"type":"object"},"currency":{"enum":["USD","EUR","GBP","AUD","CAD"],"type":"string"},"destination":{"description":"Where the buyer lives: US, GB, DE, CA or AU.","enum":["US","GB","DE","AU","CA"],"type":"string"},"limit":{"default":50,"maximum":100,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"offset":{"default":0,"maximum":10000,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"query":{"default":"","description":"Words to narrow the list, such as `m black`.","maxLength":120,"type":"string"}},"required":["canonicalProductId","destination","currency"],"type":"object"},"name":"get_product_options","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","oneOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"defaultOptionKey":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"fields":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"field":{"type":"string"},"label":{"type":"string"},"values":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false